/E (One of the most effective ways to manage risk in crypto trading is through the use of stop-loss orders. A stop-loss is an order placed with your broker or exchange to buy or sell an asset once it reaches a specified price. This is designed to limit your potential loss on a trade.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 179 0 R
/K [0]
