endobj
2570 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (For example, if you buy Bitcoin at $40,000, and you set a stop-loss order at $38,000, your position will automatically be sold if the price drops to that level. This helps limit your loss to a predetermined amount.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 179 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
