/P 4323 0 R
/E (Trailing Stop-Loss: This type of stop-loss adjusts with the price movement. For example, if Bitcoin rises from $40,000 to $42,000 and you set a trailing stop-loss at $2,000, the stop-loss would automatically adjust to $40,000. If the price drops below $40,000, your position would be sold, locking in some profits.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 180 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
2574 0 obj
