/E (1. Fibonacci Retracement and Extension Fibonacci retracement and extension tools are essential in helping traders identify potential price levels where a reversal or continuation might occur. These tools are based on the Fibonacci sequence, where each number is the sum of the two preceding ones. The most critical Fibonacci levels for traders are 23.6%, 38.2%, 50%, 61.8%, and 100%. How Fibonacci Retracement Works)
