/T (Author Bio I'm Chino, an active crypto trader and investor since 2012. Over the years, I've had the privilege of witnessing the evolution of blockchain technology firsthand, experiencing the highs and lows of the cryptocurrency market, and refining my trading strategies along the way. My journey has been fueled by a deep passion for cryptocurrencies and a firm belief in their potential to transform the way we think about money and finance. This book is my way of sharing what I've learned throughout this incredible journey. Whether you're just starting or you're a seasoned investor, I hope the insights, lessons, and strategies I present here will help you navigate the fast-paced world of digital assets and achieve your own success in crypto trading.)
